           [ 61,  78,  95]], dtype=int32)

    For higher-dimensional matrix products, batch dimensions are stacked, whereas
    in :func:`~jax.numpy.matmul` they are broadcast. For example:

    >>> a = jnp.zeros((3, 2, 4))
    >>> b = jnp.zeros((3, 4, 1))
    >>> jnp.dot(a, b).shape
    (3, 2, 3, 1)
    >>> jnp.matmul(a, b).shape
    (3, 2, 1)

